The kernel is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2
(COPYING), with the exceptions and other licenses that LICENSES/ and the
SPDX lines of individual files give. The patches change GPL-2.0 files and
are distributed under the same terms; the nixos-nanokvm patches carry no
license notice of their own and are distributed as changes to the kernel
under GPL-2.0. The device tree files are GPL-2.0 OR MIT where their SPDX
line says so, and GPL-2.0 otherwise. The configurations in ironkvm/configs/
are generated by the kernel's Kconfig and are distributed under GPL-2.0.
